<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following production and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for September 02 - September 08  and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		Sep 02-Sept 08		   TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		   1996	 1995	    1996	   1995</p>
<p> Stocks/open    314,229.9	 n/a</p>
<p> Production	32,189.5	 n/a	 358,003.0	 n/a</p>
<p> Shipment	   2,702.0	 n/a	 181,652.8	 n/a</p>
<p> Home Market	  248.3	 n/a	   2,821.7	 n/a</p>
<p> Stocks/close   343,469.1	 n/a</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
